OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud. Becoming chilly in
OL,9,Fsome sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FAll parts will have a dry
OL,12,Fday with some sunshine in the morning,
OL,13,Fturning cloudier in the afternoon.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,16,FOvernight rain and Thursday and Friday
OL,17,Fsoon clearing then dry and bright. Dry
OL,18,Fwith bright spells on Saturday.
